Looking at the graph: the foci are F₁(−4, 0) and F₂(4, 0), so the base of the triangle is |F₁F₂| = 2c = 8. The point P is the grid point (5, 4), so the height of the triangle (distance from P to the x-axis, where F₁F₂ lies) is |y_P| = 4.

Area = ½ · |F₁F₂| · |y_P| = ½ · 8 · 4 = 16.

\boxed{16}
